SUMMARY:Yolo Wine Night in Clarksburg
DESCRIPTION:The Yolo County Vineyard and Winery Association invites you to our 4th annual Yolo Wine Night. Hosted at the Old Sugar Mill\, Saturday\, August 15th at 6 pm. \nYolo Wine Night brings together Yolo County’s wineries for an evening of wine\, food\, and celebration. Taste wines from participating wineries from 6:00–7:30 PM\, then settle in with your favorite selections available by the glass while enjoying live music and local food trucks. As the sun sets\, relax with friends and savor the best of Yolo County wine country as we wine the night away. \nThis event will feature all 10+ of our Yolo Wines Wineries & tastes of their award-winning and estate-grown wines. We can’t wait to pour our favorites for you! \nThe Food – Juan’s Tacos (Bee’s Cafe)\, Charcuterie & Desserts (The Rind)\, Suck Off Oyster \n\nLive Music – Tasting: Dave in the Box \nBand: Lunar Suspect \nTicket Details: \nGeneral Admission $45 / DD/Minor tickets are $25 \nDay of tickets sold at the door GA $55 / DD $35 \nLocation : Old Sugar Mill 35265 Willow Ave\, Clarksburg\, CA 95612 \nParticipating Yolo County Wineries: Berryessa Gap Vineyards\, Capay Valley Vineyards\, Collina De Bella\, Elevation Ten\, Fjord Oak Winery\, Great Bear Vineyards\, Grindstone Wines\, Heringer Estates\, Matchbook Wine Co.\, Taber Ranch\, Turkovich Family Wines \nYou may bring your own food\, but there are No outside beverages or pets during this event.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/yolo-wine-night-in-clarksburg/
LOCATION:old sugar mill\, 35265 Willow Ave\, Clarksburg\, 95612\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Wine-glasses_web.jpg
END:VEVENT
